/**
An {@link yfiles.ICommand} to set the zoom level.
{@link yfiles.CanvasComponent} handles this command to change the viewport. If the parameter is a {@link yfiles.Point},
the viewport will be centered as that point while not changing the zoom level. If the parameter is a
{@link yfiles.Rect}, the viewport will encompass that rectangle and change the zoom level accordingly. If the parameter
is an instance of {@link yfiles.ILookup} which returns an instance of {@link yfiles.IBoundsProvider}, that {@link yfiles.IBoundsProvider}
will be used to obtain a rectangle, which will be used in the same manner as the {@link yfiles.Rect} mentioned before.
This can be used to zoom to a specific
{@link yfiles.IModelItem}. Finally, if the parameter is a number, it will be used as the new zoom level to set.
There is no default shortcut for this command.
@see {@link yfiles.ICommand.INCREASE_ZOOM}
@see {@link yfiles.ICommand.DECREASE_ZOOM}
@const*/
static readonly ZOOM: yfiles.ICommand;
