allowReparentToNonGroupNodes?: boolean;
/**
A value determining whether {@link yfiles.GraphEditorInputMode.createNode node creation} by clicking on an empty canvas location is enabled. This option sets the {@link yfiles.GraphEditorInputMode.allowCreateNode} property on the created object.*/
