/**
Converts the argument to {@link yfiles.TabularLayoutPolicy}.
@param value The value to convert to {@link yfiles.TabularLayoutPolicy}.
@returns Either `value` if it is already a {@link yfiles.TabularLayoutPolicy} or an appropriate converted value.*/
