/**
Edges at ports are lengthened if their port is {@link yfiles.IShapeGeometry.isInside outside} of its owners {@link yfiles.IShapeGeometry.getOutline outline}.
The port is moved along the lengthened edge until it hits the outline. If prolonging the edge wouldn't hit the outline,
the port location is kept.*/
LENGTHEN,
/**
Edges at ports are shortened if their port is {@link yfiles.IShapeGeometry.isInside inside} of its owners {@link yfiles.IShapeGeometry.getOutline outline}.
The port is moved along the edge until it hits the outline.*/
SHORTEN,
/**
Edges at ports are lengthened or shortened if their port is not on its owners {@link yfiles.IShapeGeometry.getOutline outline}.
The port is moved along the (lengthened) edge until it hits the outline. If starting outside and prolonging the edge
wouldn't hit the outline, the port location is kept.*/
