/**
An optimization strategy that especially reduces overlaps between labels.
@see {@link yfiles.MISLabelingBase.optimizationStrategy}*/
LABEL_OVERLAP,
/**
An optimization strategy that especially reduces overlaps between labels and edges.
@see {@link yfiles.MISLabelingBase.optimizationStrategy}*/
EDGE_OVERLAP,
/**
An optimization strategy that mainly tries to satisfy the preferences described by a {@link yfiles.PreferredPlacementDescriptor}
associated with edge labels.
@see {@link yfiles.MISLabelingBase.optimizationStrategy}*/
PREFERRED_PLACEMENT,
