/**
Data provider key for specifying a minimum distance for each node
The default minimum distance specified by {@link yfiles.ShuffleLayout.minimumNodeDistance} will be ignored for a node if the {@link yfiles.IDataProvider} registered
with this key contains a valid minimum distance for that node.
Minimum distance values need to be greater than `0`.
## Note
If no {@link yfiles.IDataProvider} with this key is registered, the minimum distance for all nodes is specified by {@link yfiles.ShuffleLayout.minimumNodeDistance}.
[Read this documentation online](https://docs.yworks.com/yfileshtml/#/api/ShuffleLayout%23MINIMUM_DISTANCE_DP_KEY).
@const*/
