/**
the core layout algorithm*/
coreLayout?: yfiles.ILayoutAlgorithm | null;
/**
Whether or not multi-parent structures (structures of multiple nodes that share the same predecessors as well as the same successors) are allowed. This option sets the {@link yfiles.TreeReductionStage.multiParentAllowed} property on the created object.*/
